SUMMARY:A Taste of Science
DESCRIPTION:A TASTE OF SCIENCE: It’s the Biggest Science Party of the Year!\nThursday\, October 22th from 6-9 pm\nJoin us for A Taste of Science- an evening of entertainment\, food\, drinks\, and science – all to benefit Lancaster Science Factory! This event helps us meet our mission to inspire curiosity\, creativity\, and confidence in young learners. Help us ensure our hands-on STEM experiences are accessible to all students across Lancaster County. This is a 21+ event. \nLearn more about our nonprofit mission. \nTickets coming soon! \n  \nIf your business is interested in supporting A Taste of Science\, click here for more information about sponsorship. If you are interested in contributing a silent auction or raffle item\, click here for our contribution form and contact rreed@tlsf.org to coordinate pick up or drop off. \n  \nYOUR TICKET INCLUDES:\n\nLive Science Trivia hosted by Drew’s Clues – participate in a team of up to 8 people!\nDinner catered by Frisco’s Peruvian Chicken – vegetarian options available!\nExciting Silent Auctions and Raffles – local experiences\, special gifts\, food\, booze\, and more!\nScience-themed cocktails curated and served by Lancaster’s Thistle Finch Distillery.\nLots of prizes and surprises\, plus time to explore our hands-on exhibits throughout the Science Factory!\n\n  \nCheck out some highlights from previous A Taste of Science events!
URL:https://lancastersciencefactory.org/event/a-taste-of-science-2/
LOCATION:The Lancaster Science Factory\, 454 New Holland Ave\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lancastersciencefactory.org/wp-content/uploads/ATOS-Announcement-2026-Web-Events-Cover.png
GEO:40.0461822;-76.2963319
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The Lancaster Science Factory 454 New Holland Ave Lancaster PA 17602 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=454 New Holland Ave:geo:-76.2963319,40.0461822
